---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../../components/Nav/Nav.astro";
import ContentPage from "../../components/ContentPage/ContentPage.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer/Footer.astro";

const lang = "en";
---

<Layout
  lang={lang}
  title="MANIFESTO — IV Devs"
  description="The values that drive IV Devs: respect, good faith, collaboration, and the desire to share knowledge in the IV Region."
>
  <Nav lang={lang} />

  <ContentPage lang={lang} title="MANIFESTO" eyebrow="// COMMUNITY">
    <p>
      Everyone who is part of this community firmly believes that inside every
      person there is an <strong>unmatched potential</strong> to create and
      positively affect those around us. Even more so when that ability joins
      others: <strong>the whole is greater than the sum of its parts</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>We are respectful</h2>
    <p>
      In a community there are diverse opinions and points of view. We always
      accept them with respect.
    </p>

    <h2>We act in good faith</h2>
    <p>
      The contributions of other members are as important as our own, and are
      made with as good intentions as ours.
    </p>

    <h2>We are collaborators</h2>
    <p>
      There is always something to learn in every new adventure. That is why we
      are willing to collaborate with others on their projects.
    </p>

    <h2>We are open</h2>
    <p>
      There is nothing to hide: if we have difficulties or problems, we ask for
      help.
    </p>

    <h2>We share and enjoy</h2>
    <p>
      We enjoy every line of code because we know it can change the world.
      Knowledge is free: our work, experience, and results are available to the
      community.
    </p>

    <h2>We are restless and motivated</h2>
    <p>
      To make things better, to break the cycle, to be disruptive, energetic,
      and critical of our surroundings, while always motivating change.
    </p>

    <h2>Our commitment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Remain open and transparent.</li>
      <li>Contribute to the professional growth of our members.</li>
      <li>Never hide problems: solve them together.</li>
      <li>
        Be inclusive: it is our differences that make us a unique community.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      When we communicate we remain courteous and respectful, avoid pointless
      arguments, always reply —sometimes late, but always— and never spam.
    </p>
  </ContentPage>

  <Footer lang={lang} />
</Layout>
